{
 "subs": [
  {
   "text": "For 600 years, a monastery in the Carpathian mountains rang its",
   "t0": 2,
   "t1": 6.073,
   "end": 6.323,
   "n": 53
  },
  {
   "text": "bell every hour.",
   "t0": 6.323,
   "t1": 7.17,
   "end": 7.42,
   "n": 14
  },
  {
   "text": "Day and night.",
   "t0": 7.42,
   "t1": 8.381,
   "end": 11.681,
   "n": 12
  },
  {
   "text": "Not once did it miss an hour.",
   "t0": 12.181,
   "t1": 13.963,
   "end": 14.213,
   "n": 23
  },
  {
   "text": "Not in plague.",
   "t0": 14.213,
   "t1": 14.944,
   "end": 15.194,
   "n": 12
  },
  {
   "text": "Not in war.",
   "t0": 15.194,
   "t1": 15.965,
   "end": 18.865,
   "n": 9
  },
  {
   "text": "The monks never said why.",
   "t0": 19.365,
   "t1": 20.69,
   "end": 20.94,
   "n": 21
  },
  {
   "text": "The villagers below never asked.",
   "t0": 20.94,
   "t1": 22.956,
   "end": 25.856,
   "n": 28
  },
  {
   "text": "Last winter, the last monk died.",
   "t0": 26.356,
   "t1": 28.575,
   "end": 31.674999999999997,
   "n": 27
  },
  {
   "text": "At 3 a.m., the bell went silent for the first time in",
   "t0": 32.175,
   "t1": 35.507,
   "end": 35.757,
   "n": 42
  },
  {
   "text": "six centuries.",
   "t0": 35.757,
   "t1": 36.74,
   "end": 40.84,
   "n": 13
  },
  {
   "text": "In the valley, every dog turned toward the mountain",
   "t0": 41.34,
   "t1": 43.822,
   "end": 44.072,
   "n": 43
  },
  {
   "text": "and howled.",
   "t0": 44.072,
   "t1": 44.661,
   "end": 47.561,
   "n": 10
  },
  {
   "text": "But the strangest part wasn't the silence.",
   "t0": 48.061,
   "t1": 50.803,
   "end": 53.703,
   "n": 36
  },
  {
   "text": "It was the fog.",
   "t0": 54.203,
   "t1": 54.82,
   "end": 55.07,
   "n": 12
  },
  {
   "text": "It came down from the peaks and stopped above the monastery.",
   "t0": 55.07,
   "t1": 58.54,
   "end": 61.44,
   "n": 50
  },
  {
   "text": "At sunrise, the villagers saw a shape in it.",
   "t0": 61.94,
   "t1": 64.84,
   "end": 67.94,
   "n": 36
  },
  {
   "text": "A brow.",
   "t0": 68.44,
   "t1": 68.733,
   "end": 68.983,
   "n": 6
  },
  {
   "text": "A nose.",
   "t0": 68.983,
   "t1": 69.276,
   "end": 69.526,
   "n": 6
  },
  {
   "text": "Two closed eyelids.",
   "t0": 69.526,
   "t1": 70.751,
   "end": 71.001,
   "n": 17
  },
  {
   "text": "Larger than the mountain.",
   "t0": 71.001,
   "t1": 72.941,
   "end": 76.441,
   "n": 22
  },
  {
   "text": "Every hour the bell didn't ring, the eyelids opened a little more.",
   "t0": 76.941,
   "t1": 80.633,
   "end": 83.733,
   "n": 55
  },
  {
   "text": "A shepherd climbed up to ring it.",
   "t0": 84.233,
   "t1": 86.229,
   "end": 86.479,
   "n": 27
  },
  {
   "text": "The rope had been cut.",
   "t0": 86.479,
   "t1": 87.726,
   "end": 87.976,
   "n": 18
  },
  {
   "text": "From above.",
   "t0": 87.976,
   "t1": 88.724,
   "end": 92.024,
   "n": 10
  },
  {
   "text": "Inside, the monks had kept a log.",
   "t0": 92.524,
   "t1": 94.791,
   "end": 95.041,
   "n": 27
  },
  {
   "text": "One line for every hour, for 600 years.",
   "t0": 95.041,
   "t1": 98.031,
   "end": 100.931,
   "n": 32
  },
  {
   "text": "Every line said the same word.",
   "t0": 101.431,
   "t1": 103.029,
   "end": 103.279,
   "n": 25
  },
  {
   "text": "Asleep.",
   "t0": 103.279,
   "t1": 103.71,
   "end": 108.01,
   "n": 7
  },
  {
   "text": "The oldest page wasn't written in any language the monks knew.",
   "t0": 108.51,
   "t1": 112.173,
   "end": 115.273,
   "n": 52
  },
  {
   "text": "Then historians looked at other bells.",
   "t0": 115.773,
   "t1": 117.951,
   "end": 120.851,
   "n": 33
  },
  {
   "text": "Medieval bells carried an inscription: \"I call the living.",
   "t0": 121.351,
   "t1": 124.572,
   "end": 124.822,
   "n": 50
  },
  {
   "text": "I mourn the dead.",
   "t0": 124.822,
   "t1": 125.625,
   "end": 125.875,
   "n": 14
  },
  {
   "text": "I break the lightning.\"",
   "t0": 125.875,
   "t1": 127.239,
   "end": 130.339,
   "n": 20
  },
  {
   "text": "On some bells, a fourth line had been scratched out.",
   "t0": 130.839,
   "t1": 134.084,
   "end": 137.384,
   "n": 43
  },
  {
   "text": "In the Second World War, Nazi Germany took 175,000 bells from Europe's",
   "t0": 137.884,
   "t1": 142.804,
   "end": 143.054,
   "n": 59
  },
  {
   "text": "towers and melted them.",
   "t0": 143.054,
   "t1": 144.803,
   "end": 147.903,
   "n": 20
  },
  {
   "text": "That winter, villages under the empty towers reported",
   "t0": 148.403,
   "t1": 151.427,
   "end": 151.677,
   "n": 46
  },
  {
   "text": "the same fog.",
   "t0": 151.677,
   "t1": 152.48,
   "end": 155.58,
   "n": 11
  },
  {
   "text": "On the seventh night, the villagers carried their own church bell up",
   "t0": 156.08,
   "t1": 159.668,
   "end": 159.918,
   "n": 57
  },
  {
   "text": "the mountain.",
   "t0": 159.918,
   "t1": 160.652,
   "end": 163.552,
   "n": 12
  },
  {
   "text": "They hung it with their hands bleeding.",
   "t0": 164.052,
   "t1": 166.265,
   "end": 169.365,
   "n": 33
  },
  {
   "text": "Above them, the eyes were already open.",
   "t0": 169.865,
   "t1": 172.305,
   "end": 177.205,
   "n": 33
  },
  {
   "text": "It was looking at the village.",
   "t0": 177.705,
   "t1": 179.296,
   "end": 182.996,
   "n": 25
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the bell rang.",
   "t0": 183.496,
   "t1": 184.376,
   "end": 184.626,
   "n": 16
  },
  {
   "text": "And the eyes slowly closed.",
   "t0": 184.626,
   "t1": 186.231,
   "end": 189.531,
   "n": 23
  },
  {
   "text": "Not all the way.",
   "t0": 190.031,
   "t1": 190.821,
   "end": 195.121,
   "n": 13
  },
  {
   "text": "The road to the monastery was closed.",
   "t0": 195.621,
   "t1": 197.736,
   "end": 197.986,
   "n": 31
  },
  {
   "text": "A new monk was sent.",
   "t0": 197.986,
   "t1": 199.015,
   "end": 199.265,
   "n": 16
  },
  {
   "text": "No one knows where they found him.",
   "t0": 199.265,
   "t1": 201.438,
   "end": 204.538,
   "n": 28
  },
  {
   "text": "Somewhere near you, a bell still rings every hour.",
   "t0": 205.038,
   "t1": 208.105,
   "end": 208.355,
   "n": 42
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody remembers why.",
   "t0": 208.355,
   "t1": 209.776,
   "end": 212.876,
   "n": 19
  },
  {
   "text": "Maybe the question isn't why they ring.",
   "t0": 213.376,
   "t1": 215.305,
   "end": 215.555,
   "n": 33
  },
  {
   "text": "Maybe it's who will ring them when we're gone.",
   "t0": 215.555,
   "t1": 218.078,
   "end": 220.278,
   "n": 38
  }
 ],
